WEBVTT

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.040
Are you familiar with the 
term "spirited away," Shino?

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.700
Doesn't it refer to when 
someone suddenly vanishes?

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:14.490
Generally speaking, it's mostly 
kids who get spirited away.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.700
Just recently, they allegedly 
found a child in a

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.140
place called Ikura who 
had been spirited away.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.790
He had vanished without a trace when he

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.270
left to gather some bellflower 
roots for his sickly mother.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:35.960
He looks the same as he did 
when he vanished a year ago.

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:37.600
Yeah?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.250
They must be happy to have him back.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.730
Think a mountain deity or 
somethin' took a liking to him?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.230
Shino, I said that a 
boy in the midst of

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:50.420
his growth spurt returned 
looking as he did a year ago.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.770
Wouldn't you like to meet him?

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:58.120
IKURA PUBLIC

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:00.490
So why the heck...

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.490
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:06.000
IKURA PUBLIC ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.600
...do I have to attend 
elementary school?!

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.480
Isn't it a bit late for that?

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:12.380
This goes along with your 
job, so please do it well.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.510
YEAR 6 CLASS 3

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.510
This is Shino Inuzuka.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.290
He transferred from 
the Imperial Capital.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:21.260
Shino INUZUKA

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.190
Everyone, try to be nice to him!

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.260
Okay!

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.150
Man!

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.780
Your seat is next to the 
class officer, Shinobu Inue.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:30.370
Nice to meet you!

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:31.320
Hi!

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.420
I imagine you'll recognize 
him when you see him.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:46.970
Sure enough...

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.740
Are you interested in Akihiko?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:26.000
Spirited Away

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.860
Uh, weren't you... Inue?

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.680
Call me Shinobu.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.020
And I'll call you Shino, okay?

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:32.320
And for the record, 
that's Akihiko Narumura.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.450
He's been through some stuff 
and just resumed classes,

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.800
so he's a year older than us.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.380
Oh, are you also on the older side?

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.970
Why'd ya ask?

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.150
Our teacher said that 
you're sickly and that

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.780
this is your first 
time attending school.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.340
Oh, is that right?

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.600
Yeah, I'm actually 13.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.920
I knew it!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.790
You seemed a bit mature.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.550
We have some great hot springs,

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.800
so you can gradually 
build up your strength.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.380
And then we can hang out a lot!

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.190
My conscience... is killing me!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.260
Welcome back, Sosuke!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.190
Ma'am!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:27.320
KAKIYA INN

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.810
How did Young Master Shino 
take to his new school?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.510
He is getting along with 
everyone nicely... I think.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.630
I'm glad to hear it.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.950
Oh, yes! That's right, Sosuke!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:32.330
Make sure not to allow Young Master 
Shino outdoors after sunset.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:33.700
Ma'am?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.140
And he mustn't go near the mountains.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.340
Are there dangerous animals 
around these parts?

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:42.590
Yes, indeed. They are dangerous.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.090
They are especially fond of children.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:50.320
They steal away our 
children because of their

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.770
innocence and pure hearts.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.100
We have to be careful...

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.150
He never said a word all day...

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.810
And none of the other kids in class 
paid him a lick of attention.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.620
What's going on?

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.010
Shino!

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.730
Your attendant is here for you.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:32.850
Is something the matter?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:34.450
It's nothing.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:42.340
Shino... Young Master, what 
did you think of school?

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.650
The bastard!

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.530
Shinobu, please look after Akihiko.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.030
Okay!

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.890
What?! Shino, you're staying 
at my family's inn?

00:05:55.890 --> 00:06:01.040
Right. I take it you must 
be Tae's grandson, Shinobu.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.930
We just missed each other this morning.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.050
Yeah. I was on cleaning duty today.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.050
KAKIYA INN

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:13.190
Well, I have to walk Akihiko home.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.700
Is he the one?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:19.560
Sure is.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.560
He's been like that all day today.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.350
He has an unusual air about him.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:38.710
Still, normally wouldn't people 
make a bigger fuss over

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.080
a lost kid who turns back up?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.960
Even at school, no one 
seemed to really care.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.100
Perhaps they are being considerate of

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.670
his feelings and trying 
to avoid the topic.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.470
Even elementary school brats?

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:55.470
Come to think of it, Tae said 
something rather peculiar.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.230
She said children mustn't 
go outside after sunset.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.280
And that "they are especially 
fond of children."

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.850
Cut the crap!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.240
It's already been a month!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:12.240
You haven't said a word since 
you came back from the mountain!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:15.340
And I'm supposed to 
believe you're my son?!

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:20.510
And... not to mention that hair...

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.250
It's freaking white!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.690
Plus you hardly eat a thing.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.320
You just drink water!

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:33.510
What the hell happened to you...?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.370
I'm sorry, Akihiko.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.410
My loud coughs always 
bothered you, didn't they?

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.650
But now you'll be able 
to sleep well at night.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.660
I'm being admitted into a clinic today.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.160
Please look after Father, okay?

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:09.480
I wish I told Mother that I don't 
hate her, just her sickness.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:15.480
But since I didn't tell her, 
Mother has never come back...

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.910
Return to us...

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:24.940
Return to us...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:28.790
...our flower...

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.450
Class Diary

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.450
By any chance, are you 
two always together?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.460
Yep! It's not safe to 
leave Akihiko alone.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:44.920
It's not?

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.960
If you leave him alone, he'll 
lap up water from puddles.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:51.460
The other day, when I 
realized he was missing,

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.470
I found him on the 
school roof sunbathing.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.970
Uh, I gotcha...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:01.240
Yeah. Well, I have to take the 
class diary to the Teacher's Room.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:04.110
Shino, could you keep an eye on Akihiko?

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:06.280
S-sure...

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.450
I had a feeling he wouldn't talk...

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:16.030
But I can sense that he 
has a will of his own.

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.590
It-it's the one from yesterday!

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:25.960
Crap! Murasame!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:26.970
I can't go.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.110
I can't go...

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.260
with you.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.230
It vanished?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.130
Why if it isn't Chudai!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:02.790
Oh, Granny Tae! Still 
alive and kicking, I see!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.720
The same goes for you!

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:10.040
What have you been up to 
of late, you crazy monk?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:14.050
Well, you see, I've been on a 
pilgrimage across the country!

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.250
I've found you, evil spirits!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.090
I, Chudai, I will exorcize you promptly!

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:31.070
Is your grandson doing well?

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:33.560
Thanks to you, he's 
bursting with energy!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.010
He should be home shortly.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.740
He'll be delighted to see you.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.240
Grandma, I'm home!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.800
Oh! How've you been doing, Shinobu?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.620
Father Chudai!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.000
Long time no see!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.600
What brought you here today?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.430
Crap!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.630
Hey, Granny Tae! That brat is bad news!

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:01.610
I don't care if Kona-ya sent 
a letter of introduction!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.140
Kick the punk out!

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.820
Goodness, no! I could never.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.400
The therapeutic baths brought 
Young Master Shino here

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.910
because of his sickly disposition.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.730
Sickly disposition?!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.400
You couldn't kill him if 
you tried, so rest at ease!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.670
Regardless of what you say, there 
are simply some things I cannot do!

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:20.040
I've already accepted a 
handsome down payment.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.960
Furthermore, Young Master Shino 
is in Master Satomi's charge.

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:27.300
He-he's in Master Satomi's...?!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:33.790
Young Master Shino! It's 
about time you woke up.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.310
It's a beautiful, refreshing morning.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.810
How is this beautiful and refreshing?

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.930
How is anything about this 
beautiful and refreshing?!

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:49.810
Well, he took some 
unnecessary measures...

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.580
Wow... This is impressive.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.080
What's all this about?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.250
Like this is about anything!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.070
What does that damn monk take me for?!

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:04.250
Shino, I think you'd be more like 
an imp than a vengeful spirit.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.580
What?! Why would I be such a small fry?

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.100
For the record, Father Chudai 
may be kind of quirky,

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.580
but he isn't a bad guy!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:14.790
Then why is he treating me like this?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.020
Uh, yeah... That might be my fault.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:18.590
Huh?

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:24.340
You see, Father Chudai saved 
my life once when I was little.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.520
The whole reason why he 
suddenly came to pay a visit

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.810
was probably because he's 
still concerned about

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.350
what happened and has grown 
a bit over protective.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:37.080
I take it Master Satomi 
has custody of that boy.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.150
Yes, that's right.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.360
Are you an acquaintance of Mr. Satomi's?

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.620
Yeah, I know him well!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:50.180
That radiant and divine aura!

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:54.050
With his beauty and unrivaled gifts, 
he is renowned as a prodigy!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:55.580
He is truly the one in this generation

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.400
most worthy of inheriting 
the Princess Fuse name!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:01.630
Mr. Satomi, what exactly 
did you do to this man?!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:06.030
And curse that wretched Finnegan 
of the Imperial Church!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:10.010
How dare that smirking pervert 
become Master Satomi's guardian!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.070
Shino, hurry it up!

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.400
Our next class is about to start.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.450
Gosh darn it!

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.040
You just had to play 
tag in the playground.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.500
Akihiko!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.080
Shino! Akihiko!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.010
Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.300
I'm fine!

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.970
Akihiko, did you hit your head?

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:43.390
Water?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.260
Narumura

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:52.570
Shinobu, I'm sorry that you had 
to leave early with Akihiko.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.530
I don't mind any.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.770
Akihiko, is your father at the clinic?

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.900
What? You'd like more water?

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:12.660
Shinobu, you can tell what 
Akihiko is thinking, can't you?

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.970
Yeah, more or less.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.880
I wonder if it's because 
you're special, Shinobu.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.830
Maybe. I'm not really sure.

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:25.170
Wh-what are you doing, Dear?

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:29.360
Isn't it obvious? I've 
been feeling good lately,

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:33.430
so I asked the doctors for 
permission to go home for a while.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:34.610
What?

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:37.520
Darling, you haven't 
brought Akihiko to come

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.790
see me once since he's come home!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:43.190
Well, that's because... 
this is far out...

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.710
And he's still emotionally unstable...

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:48.330
I'd imagine so.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.200
That's why I'm going to him.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.210
What's the matter?

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.590
You've been staring at your hand.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.100
Did you get hurt when you 
fell down the stairs?

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.400
Of course not!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:06.210
And how do you know about 
my falling down the stairs?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:09.220
The girls from your class told me.

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:12.190
It must be nice, Shino, 
to be so beloved.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.190
Young Master Shino!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.720
It's you they love!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:20.600
Oh, about Father Chudai.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.600
He knows Mr. Satomi.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.620
What?!

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:26.730
As a result, he's willing to forget 
what's happened between us.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.990
How dare he act so high and mighty!

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.440
Evidently he rushed over in

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.990
the fear that spirits were 
related to that one incident.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.800
Oh, come to think of it,

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:40.050
Shinobu said that he 
owed that monk his life.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:40.750
Right.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:44.330
So how is it going? Have 
you learned anything?

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.120
When Mr. Satomi explained the situation,

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.510
didn't the thought cross your mind?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:54.010
That this could be the eighth person.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:55.760
Yeah...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.340
But how to put it?

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.190
He isn't one of us...

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.020
I still have a glimmer of hope.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.880
If we could maintain your bond with

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.320
Murasame while unfreezing 
time for you, Shino...

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.020
I have hope that we'll find something, 
like a hint, that will help...

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.540
You don't know when to give up, sheesh!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:22.400
I know!

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:25.290
When it comes to you, Shino, I 
don't want to give up on anything.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:38.990
Right now, I am merely a vessel 
that Murasame is keeping alive.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.060
Even if I got my old body back, 
I wouldn't have long to live.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.410
I won't ask for much.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:46.580
I'm fine as I am.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.560
Shino!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.670
My wish lies elsewhere...

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.820
Shino!

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.840
Hey, Shinobu.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:01.080
You have great timing. I 
need to check somethin' out.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.090
Could you tell me where the 
path to the mountains is?

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:06.580
Huh? What are you going to 
check out in the mountains?

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:09.340
Something my guardian 
asked me to look into.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.020
I can't say more than that.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.560
But Shino, you're sickly and frail!

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.590
It's too late to climb up the mountains.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:18.880
Oh, sorry! I was lyin' about all that.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.350
Wh-what?!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:29.610
H-hey... Are you still feeling sick?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.420
No, it's just been so long 
since I've seen my own home.

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.110
I couldn't help but feel nervous.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:40.300
I'm back!

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.750
Akihiko, are you home?

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:46.850
Akihiko?

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:49.250
Goodness! What are you doing out there?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.250
It's cold outside. Why 
don't you come in?

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.620
Your hair is pure white, isn't it?

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:14.540
Father lied, telling me that 
you haven't changed at all.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:25.340
A field full of bellflowers?

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.640
Right.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:30.290
But they shouldn't be blooming 
around this time of year.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:35.800
Yeah, but weren't they in 
bloom when Akihiko vanished?

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.650
You said he went to gather 
bellflower roots, right?

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:42.430
Right. They were supposed 
to help his mom's cough.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:48.320
I was thinkin' that he might have 
been after the flowers as well.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.160
Shino, what makes you say that?

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.440
I could see them back then.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:55.940
Akihiko!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.580
Shino!

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:08.850
I'm positive the woods 
looked just like this!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:17.320
I think you may have grown some.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:21.070
Did you have a hard time 
with just you and Father?

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:27.280
Mo-th-er?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:33.090
That's right. I'm back.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:38.610
Has it been so long that you 
forgot what I looked like?

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.790
Nuh-uh. I haven't forgotten!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.880
I could never forget.

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.900
You are... my mother!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.040
A-Akihiko!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.000
Goodness! What's gotten 
into you, Father?

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.460
Akihiko!

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.770
Mother, what about your sickness?

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:06.350
The moment I saw your 
face, I got all better!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:10.400
So you don't need to go pick 
bellflowers for me anymore.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.400
Do you hate bellflowers now?

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:19.040
Of course not. I still love them.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.000
Do you still cough?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.280
I'm fine now.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:26.900
The doctors gave me some 
very good medicine.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.630
I see...

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.090
I'm glad...

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.290
Shino!

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:43.180
I told you it's dangerous here!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.680
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:49.430
But you could hardly blame Shino 
for running off like that.

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.740
I'm somewhat surprised to see 
them at this time of year.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:08.000
The promise has been fulfilled.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:13.140
So, what should we have for dinner?

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.960
Soup might be nice 
considering the season.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.420
Akihiko, could you lend me a hand?

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.560
Where did we put the pot?

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:25.770
Akihiko, do you remember?

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:32.210
It's no use. I seem...

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:34.510
to have forgotten...

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:48.750
"Send flowers to my mother."

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:53.310
That was this child's wish...

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:41.020
Encompassing Heavens

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:28.590
Shino! Shino!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:29.910
Shut up!

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:30.270
Wake up!

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:32.350
Don't disturb me when I'm napping.

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:35.260
Why not?! I wanna chit chat.

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:36.370
Not my problem.

00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:40.150
I didn't get to say a 
thing in this episode!

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:40.640
I wanna-
